OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe odd shower is possible on
OL,6,FMonday, however for the most part it
OL,7,Fwill stay dry with variable cloud and
OL,8,Fbright or sunny spells. Breezy
OL,9,Fsouthwesterly winds will ease through
OL,10,Fthe day.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will be a dry and settled
OL,13,Fnight with mostly light winds,
OL,14,Falthough perhaps a little breezier
OL,15,Facross Orkney later in the night.
OL,16,FMostly cloudy but some clear spells
OL,17,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
