OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA dry day with mostly light
OL,6,Fsoutheasterly winds to start, but
OL,7,Fwinds strengthening through the day.
OL,8,FLargely cloudy but some good sunny
OL,9,Fspells breaking through in the
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,13,Fon Wednesday with rain spreading
OL,14,Feastwards and gales or severe gales.
OL,15,FMostly dry Thursday with long spells
OL,16,Fof sunshine and winds easing. Dry
OL,17,Fspells Friday with rain later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
